    "Every tool is off until you turn it on. Turning one on also switches iPhone on in the profile you are using; other profiles choose for themselves. What a tool reads, such as your events or contacts, is sent to the AI model you chose.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every tool is off until you turn it on. Turning one on also switches iPhone on in the profile you are using; other profiles choose for themselves. What a tool reads, such as your events or contacts, is sent to the AI model you chose."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Každý nástroj je vypnutý, dokud ho nezapnete. Zapnutím se iPhone zapne i v profilu, který právě používáte; ostatní profily si vybírají samy. To, co nástroj přečte, třeba události nebo kontakty, se posílá AI modelu, který jste vybrali."
          }
        }
