    "Subagents start reading and looking things up while you are still talking, so answers come sooner. It uses more model calls. Anything that changes something waits until you finish. Takes effect the next time you turn the microphone on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subagents start reading and looking things up while you are still talking, so answers come sooner. It uses more model calls. Anything that changes something waits until you finish. Takes effect the next time you turn the microphone on."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subagenti začnou číst a hledat, zatímco ještě mluvíte, takže odpověď přijde dřív. Spotřebuje to víc volání modelu. Cokoli, co něco mění, počká, až domluvíte. Projeví se při dalším zapnutí mikrofonu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
