    "Voice Agent has no server of its own. What you type or say, and what your tools return, is sent only to the AI model, speech and MCP services you set up, under their own privacy terms.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Agent has no server of its own. What you type or say, and what your tools return, is sent only to the AI model, speech and MCP services you set up, under their own privacy terms."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Agent nemá vlastní server. To, co napíšete nebo řeknete, a to, co vrátí vaše nástroje, se posílá jen službám AI modelů, řeči a MCP, které si nastavíte, a platí pro ně jejich vlastní podmínky ochrany soukromí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
